        "value": "<p>Masters of psionic power, Psions wield magic and extraordinary powers through the power of thought. They develop their minds as fonts of power that manifest spells and grow stronger over the course of their adventuring careers.</p>\n               <h3>Quick Build</h3>\n               <p>Make <strong>Intelligence</strong> your highest ability score, as it governs your Psion spells, save DCs, and Psionic Energy Dice. Your next highest score should be <strong>Constitution</strong> or <strong>Dexterity</strong>.</p>",
